WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.435
CNN's SARA SIDNER IS IN PHOENIX
OUTSIDE THE MARICOPA COUNTY

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:06.473
ELECTION CENTER.
ONE OF THE BIGGEST POPULATION

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:09.675
CENTERS WAITING ON VOTE TOTALS
TO UPDATE.

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.445
SARA, ARIZONA HAD SOME OF THE
MOST CLOSELY WATCHED RACES ON

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:16.950
THE STATE AND NATIONAL LEVEL.
WHEN WILL WE HAVE ANSWERS?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.285
&gt;&gt; THAT IS A VERY GOOD QUESTION,
ANA.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:22.255
I WISH I COULD GIVE YOU AN EXACT
NUMBER BUT I HAVE SOMEONE HERE

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:25.658
WHO CAN GIVE YOU SOME GREAT
NUMBERS AND UPDATED NUMBERS.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:30.263
WE ARE HERE WITH THE CHAIRMAN OF
THE MARICOPA COUNTY BOARD OF

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.699
SUPERVISORS, BILL GATES IS HERE
WITH US AND WE ARE ACTUALLY

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:37.103
INSIDE LOOKING AT THE
TABULATIONS HAPPENING RIGHT THIS

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.339
MINUTE.
THE COUNTING CONTINUES AND I

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:42.575
KNOW THAT YOU GUYS WILL BE
COUNTING UNTIL YOU ARE DONE.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:46.513
I MEAN THAT'S WHERE WE'RE AT.
CAN YOU GIVE ME A SENSE OF HOW

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:49.715
MANY PEOPLE CAME OUT TO VOTE?
WAS THIS A HUGE TURNOUT.

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:54.687
&gt;&gt; YEAH, SO THIS WAS -- WE'VE
HAD A BIG TURNOUT THROUGH THE

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.256
WHOLE ELECTION BECAUSE IT'S NOT
JUST ELECTION DAY BUT STARTED

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:58.992
EARLY VOTING SEVERAL WEEKS IN
ADVANCE OF THAT.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:03.796
WITH RESPECT TO ELECTION DAY
ITSELF WE HAD ABOUT 230,000

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:08.234
PEOPLE COME IN PERSON, BUT THEN
ALSO -- SO THEY VOTED IN

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.938
AMERICAN AND THEN IN ADDITION TO
THAT WE HAD ANOTHER 290,000

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:15.542
PEOPLE WHO CAME WITH THEIR EARLY
BALLOT, WHICH UNDER ARIZONA LAW

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.510
THEY CAN COME AND JUST DROP IT
OFF.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:22.582
THEY DON'T WANT TO WAIT IN LINE,
DROP IT OFF AND HEAD ON THEIR

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.518
DAY.
IT WAS A VERY BUSY DAY AND THAT

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.887
290,000 MAIL-IN BALLOTS THAT
WERE DROPPED OFF ON ELECTION DAY

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:32.625
WAS A RECORD AND BROKE THE
PREVIOUS RECORD BY 70%.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:36.196
&gt;&gt; 70%.
ARE YOU SAYING THAT'S THE NUMBER

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:40.133
MORE PEOPLE, 70% MORE PEOPLE
VOTED IN THIS PARTICULAR

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.634
ELECTION?
&gt;&gt; NO, WHAT I'M SAY SOMETHING

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:47.106
THAT 70% MORE VOTED BY DROPPING
OFF THEIR EARLY BALLOT AND WHY

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:49.642
THAT'S RELEVANT IS IF YOU JUST
VOTE ON ELECTION DAY YOU PUT IT

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:54.113
IN THE TABULATOR, IT IS COUNTED
THAT DAY OR IN THE WEE HOURS OF

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:56.849
THE NEXT DAY.
IF YOU DROP OFF AN EARLY BALLOT

00:01:56.849 --> 00:02:00.553
IT MEANS IT HAS TO COME IN ON
WEDNESDAY AND START THE PROCESS

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:04.557
OF BEING SIGNATURE VERIFIED.
SO WE HAVE EXPERTS HERE WHO GO

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:07.827
THROUGH, COMPARE THE SIGNATURE
ON THE OUTSIDE OF THE BALLOT

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:11.931
ENVELOPE WITH THE SIGNATURE THAT
WE HAVE IN OUR VOTER

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:14.801
REGISTRATION FILE SO THAT TAKES
A WHILE BECAUSE WE GOT TO GET

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.437
THAT RIGHT.
WE WANT TO MAKE SURE UNDER -- WE

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:21.341
WANT TO FOLLOW THE LAW, WE WANT
TO MAKE SURE THAT EVERY ELIGIBLE

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:25.345
VOTE IS COUNTED AND, BY THE WAY,
THAT'S HOW IT'S BEEN SINCE THE

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.380
1990s.
WE'VE HAD A SIGNIFICANT AMOUNT

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.717
OF MAIL VOTING IN THIS STATE
SINCE THE 1990s.

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:35.054
THIS ISN'T NEW TO US.
I WAS HERE IN 2006 WHEN I WAS A

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:37.857
REPUBLICAN LAWYER WHO WAS HERE
WATCHING THE SITUATION MAKING

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:41.561
SURE THAT THE LAWS WERE BEING
FOLLOWED AND I SAT ON THE STEPS

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:46.666
OUTSIDE OF THIS BUILDING FOR
DAYS IN A CLOSE CONGRESSIONAL

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.001
RACE.
PEOPLE WHO ARE SAYING WHAT'S

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:51.137
GOING ON HERE, THEY HAVEN'T BEEN
PAYING ATTENTION THE WAY I HAVE

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:54.574
AND A LOT OF MY FRIENDS ARE.
THIS IS HOW WE RUN ELECTIONS IN

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:56.709
ARIZONA.
IF PEOPLE DON'T LIKE THAT THEY

00:02:56.709 --> 00:03:00.713
CAN GO TO THE LEGISLATURE AND
HAVE THEM PASS NEW LAWS BUT IN

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.082
MARICOPA COUNTY WE FOLLOW THE
LAWS THAT ARE PASSED BY THE

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:07.220
STATE LEGISLATURE.
&gt;&gt; THAT IS YOUR MESSAGE TO THOSE

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.121
QUESTIONING WHAT'S HAPPENING.
THERE HAVE BEEN A LOT OF

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:12.225
ALLEGATIONS, I LASTLY WANT TO
ASK IF YOU CAN GIVE PE A COUPLE

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:15.762
OF VOTE COUNTS.
HOW MANY VOTES FROM TODAY ARE

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:17.864
YOU STILL -- DO YOU TILL HAVE TO
COUNT?

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:20.800
IN OTHER WORDS, HOW MANY VOTES
THAT WERE BROUGHT IN ON THE DAY

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.937
OF THE ELECTION IN THOSE
ENVELOPES DO YOU STILL HAVE TO

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:26.606
COUNT?
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO COUNT ALL OF THOSE

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:28.941
THAT WERE BROUGHT IN FROM
ELECTION DAY.

00:03:28.941 --> 00:03:31.544
NONE HAVE BEEN COUNTED AND
REPORTED, THE 290,000.

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:35.615
&gt;&gt; THAT IS FOR SURE 290,000.
&gt;&gt; MAKES UP PART OF THAT

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:37.717
400,000, THAT'S RIGHT.
&gt;&gt; SO WE'RE STILL AT THAT

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:38.985
NUMBER.
BILL GATES, I APPRECIATE YOUR

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:40.353
TIME.
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR LETTING

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:43.856
US IN TO SEE THE PROCESS.
AND WE ARE GOING TO SEND IT BACK

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:47.827
TO YOU STILL.
WE'RE ABOUT BETWEEN 400,000 AND

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:50.229
410,000 VOTES IN MARICOPA COUNTY
THAT STILL NEED TO BE COUNTED

00:03:50.229 --> 00:03:54.467
AND THAT IS A HUGE NUMBER
BECAUSE THERE'S ONLY ABOUT

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:57.837
560,000 VOTES ACROSS THE STATE
THAT STILL NEED TO BE COUNTED.

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:00.640
WE'LL GIVE YOU AN UPDATE AS SOON
AS WE GET ONE.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.745
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU ASK BILL WHEN HE
ESTIMATES THOSE VOTES IN

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:09.716
MARICOPA COUNTY WILL BE COUNTED?
&gt;&gt; YES, YES.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:13.653
YOU KNOW WE DO THIS TO YOU EVERY
DAY AND I'M GOING TO HAVE TO DO

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:17.023
IT TO YOU AGAIN.
WHEN DO YOU ANTICIPATE THE VOTES

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:20.360
WILL BE COUNTED IN TOTAL, THOSE
400,000 PLUS VOTES.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:25.698
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE HAVE -- WE WILL BE
GOING INTO NEXT WEEK.

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:31.170
THERE ARE ONESIES, TWOSIES BUT I
THINK WE'LL SEE THE LION'S SHARE

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:34.006
WRAP UP BY EARLY NEXT WEEK.
&gt;&gt; EARLY NEXT WEEK.

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:38.044
CAN YOU GIVE ME A DAY, ARE WE
TALKING MONDAY?

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:41.481
&gt;&gt; MAYBE -- AS LONG AS YOU WON'T
HOLD ME TO IT, YOU ABOUT I THINK

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:44.917
THAT'S WHAT WE'RE LOOKING AT AT
THIS POINT AGAIN GIVEN THE

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:47.153
NUMBER OF BALLOTS HERE, THE
ARIZONA LAWS WE HAVE TO FOLLOW

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:49.756
AND THE FACT THAT ACCURACY COMES
FIRST.

00:04:49.756 --> 00:04:53.726
&gt;&gt; THERE YOU GO, ACCURACY COMES
FIRST.

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:56.629
BILL, JUST TELLING US, LOOK,
IT'S PROBABLY GOING TO BE EARLY

00:04:56.629 --> 00:05:00.433
NEXT WEEK, WE KNEW THAT I THINK
ON -- YOU THOUGHT MAYBE FRIDAY

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:03.436
95% TO 99% BUT THAT CHANGED
PARTLY BECAUSE THERE WERE SO

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:06.406
MANY PEOPLE WHO CAME IN AND
DROPPED THOSE BALLOTS, THOSE

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:10.143
EARLY BALLOTS OFF THE DAY OF THE
ELECTION SO THAT'S WHERE WE ARE

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:12.512
AND I PROMISE YOU WE'LL GIVE YOU
THE INFORMATION AS SOON AS WE

00:05:12.512 --> 00:05:14.514
GET IT.
THERE WILL BE ANOTHER COUNT THAT

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:17.817
HAPPENS, I THINK, THIS EVENING
AND AN ANNOUNCEMENT.

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.585
&gt;&gt; THAT'S CORRECT.
&gt;&gt; BOTH THE AGGRESSIVE'S RACE

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:23.089
AND SENATE RACE THERE IN ARIZONA
ARE KEY RACES EVERYBODY IS

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.558
WATCHING.
THANKS, SARA AND BILL GATES.

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:28.561
&gt;&gt;&gt; NOW TO NEVADA, THE SENATE
AND GOVERNOR RACES BOTH TOO

00:05:28.561 --> 00:05:32.465
CLOSE TO CALL THERE AS WELL.
CNN'S ROSA FLORES IS IN LAS

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:34.534
VEGAS OUTSIDE THE CLARK COUNTY
ELECTION DEPARTMENT.

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:38.271
ROSA, WHEN DO YOU EXPECT THE
FINAL VOTES COUNTED THERE?

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:41.674
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YOU KNOW, ANA,
WE'VE BEEN ASKING THAT SAME

00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:46.312
QUESTION JUST LIKE BILL TOLD
SARA AND WE'RE GETTING VERY

00:05:46.312 --> 00:05:49.849
SIMILAR -- IN HE TENSE, THEY
DON'T KNOW BUT HERE IN NEVADA WE

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:53.686
KNOW BY LAW THE UNOFFICIAL
RESULTS HAVE TO BE PRESENTED BY

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:57.757
NOVEMBER 18th SO THAT'S NEXT
FRIDAY AND, OF COURSE, EVERYONE

00:05:57.757 --> 00:06:02.127
HERE WATCHING THESE TWO RACES,
BOTH THE U.S. SENATE RACE AND

00:06:02.127 --> 00:06:06.999
ALSO THE GOVERNOR'S RACE, THE
MARGINS ARE RAZOR THIN.

00:06:06.999 --> 00:06:10.203
WE ARE WATCHING THIS.
NOW, OVERNIGHT THE U.S. SENATE

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:15.475
RACE GOT EVEN TIGHTER.
IT'S LESS THAN 3%, RIGHT NOW THE

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:19.178
INDIVIDUAL WHO IS IN THE LEAD IS
THE REPUBLICAN.

00:06:19.178 --> 00:06:24.116
ADAM LAXALT, THE INCUMBENT
DEMOCRAT, CATHERINE CORTEZ

00:06:24.116 --> 00:06:28.921
MASTO, IS TRAILING BY UNDER 3%,
BUT OF THE BALLOTS THAT ARE

00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:32.158
COMING IN, THE BALLOTS THAT HAVE
COME IN OVERNIGHT THEY HAVE BEEN

00:06:32.158 --> 00:06:37.830
TRENDING IN HER FAVOR.
NOW, WE ARE HEARING FROM BOTH

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:43.069
CAMPAIGNS TAKING TO TWITTER TO
SAY THE FOLLOWING, THE

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:46.806
COMMUNICATIONS DIRECTOR FROM
CATHERINE CORTEZ MASTO'S

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:49.308
CAMPAIGN SAYING LOOKING AT THE
NUMBERS THAT CONTINUE TO COME IN

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:54.313
AND WE'RE ON TRACK TO WIN, ADAM
LAXALT ALSO TAKING TO TWITTER

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:58.250
SAYING LAST NIGHT WHENT EXACTLY
AS WE ANTICIPATED.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:02.855
HE SAYS, HE ADDED MORE IN THE
RULES AT THE END THERE, HE SAYS,

00:07:02.855 --> 00:07:07.260
NO STATUS CHANGE AND WHAT HE
MEANS BY THAT, ANA IS THAT HE

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.029
COULD WIN AS WELL.
BOTH CAMPS CLINGING ON TO EVERY

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:13.065
SINGLE VOTE, TENS OF THOUSAND,
THOUGH, ARE STILL REMAINING TO

00:07:13.065 --> 00:07:16.802
BE COUNTED, ANA.
&gt;&gt; WE KNOW THOSE BALLOTS HAD TO

00:07:16.802 --> 00:07:21.641
BE POSTMARKED BY ELECTION DAY
AND ARRIVE BY SATURDAY, SO THOSE

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:25.845
BALLOTS ARE STILL ARRIVING AND
WILL BE COUNTED THIS WEEKEND OR

00:07:25.845 --> 00:07:27.113
BEYOND.
ROSA FLORES, THANK YOU.

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:31.884
&gt;&gt;&gt; NOW, IF DEMOCRATS LOSE
EITHER NEVADA OR ARIZONA SENATE

00:07:31.884 --> 00:07:35.454
RACES, IT WOULD ALL COME DOWN TO
GEORGIA AGAIN.

00:07:35.454 --> 00:07:39.191
DEJA VU AND IT WILL BE WEEKS
BEFORE WE HAVE THAT WINNER, A

00:07:39.191 --> 00:07:42.895
RUNOFF ELECTION IS SCHEDULED FOR
DECEMBER 6th.

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:45.498
CNN'S NICK VALENCIA IS IN NORTH
OF ATLANTA.

00:07:45.498 --> 00:07:49.035
ARE WE ALREADY SEEING NATIONAL
MONEY FUNNELING INTO THIS SPRINT

00:07:49.035 --> 00:07:51.337
TO THE FINISH?
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WELL, WE ARE SEEING

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:55.875
THE START OF THE CAVALRY OF TOP
REPUBLICANS COMING TO TOWN, ANA,

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:59.979
WHEN LATER HERSCHEL WALKER KICKS
OFF HIS RUNOFF CAMPAIGNING

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:03.849
ALONGSIDE SENATOR TED CRUZ SO
SEEING THIS DOUBLING DOWN IN THE

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:06.052
INVESTMENT BY THE GOP AND
WALKER'S CAMPAIGN AND SHOULD

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:08.254
EXPECT TO SEE THE SAME FROM
DEMOCRATS WHEN IT COMES TO

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:11.223
RAPHAEL WARNOCK.
ONE OF THE BIGGEST QUESTIONS

00:08:11.223 --> 00:08:12.725
THOUGH AFTER TUESDAY'S ELECTION
IS WHETHER OR NOT WE WILL SEE

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:15.728
THE FORMER PRESIDENT HERE,
DONALD TRUMP, OR IF WALKER WILL

00:08:15.728 --> 00:08:20.166
BEGIN TO DISTANCE HIMSELF FROM
HIS LONGTIME ALLEY JUST LIKE

00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:22.802
WE'VE SEEN A LOT OF REPUBLICANS
DO SO SINCE THE ELECTION.

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:26.339
JUST LISTEN TO LIEUTENANT
GOVERNOR HERE IN GEORGIA GEOFF

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:29.241
DUNCAN AND WHAT HE SAID TO OUR
ANCHORS ON CNN THIS MORNING.

00:08:29.241 --> 00:08:31.777
&gt;&gt; IT'S MY VISION IF ANYBODY IN
THE HERSCHEL WALKER TEAM WANTED

00:08:31.777 --> 00:08:35.081
TO LISTEN WOULD BE TO MAKE THREE
SUCCESSFUL PHONE CALL, ONE TELL

00:08:35.081 --> 00:08:37.950
DONALD TRUMP TO STAY OUT OF
GEORGIA FOR FOUR WEEKS, HE'S

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.919
TOXIC AND WOULD DO NOTHING TO
HELP THE TICKET.

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:42.355
SECONDLY I WOULD PICK UP THE
PHONE AND CALL BRIAN KEMP AND

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:45.891
ASK HIM FOR HIS HELP AND
APOLOGIZE FOR NOT ENDORSING HIM

00:08:45.891 --> 00:08:49.128
IN THE PRIMARY AGAINST PURDUE
AND CALL RON DeSANTIS AND ASK

00:08:49.128 --> 00:08:52.198
HIM TO COME TO GEORGIA AS OFTEN
AS HE POSSIBLY CAN THE NEXT FOUR

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:54.767
WEEKS.
&gt;&gt; YOU HEAR DUNCAN MENTION BRIAN

00:08:54.767 --> 00:08:58.337
KEMP, A BIG TAKEAWAY FROM
TUESDAY HOW MUCH WALKER

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:01.307
UNDERPERFORMED KEMP, ABOUT
163,000 VOTES WITH KEMP NOT ON

00:09:01.307 --> 00:09:03.843
THIS RUNOFF, HOW IS THAT GOING
TO IMPACT WALKER'S ATTEMPT TO

00:09:03.843 --> 00:09:06.612
GET OUT THE VOTE?
MEANWHILE HAPPENING RIGHT NOW,

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:10.049
RAPHAEL WARNOCK IS HOSTING HIS
KICKOFF TO HIS RUNOFF

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:13.352
CAMPAIGNING JUST DOWN THE STREET
FROM HIS OLD CHURCH EBENEZER

00:09:13.352 --> 00:09:16.022
BAPTIST, THE START OF A VERY
LONG FOUR WEEKS FOR BOTH

00:09:16.022 --> 00:09:17.523
CANDIDATE, ANA. 

